cookbook/decisions/restart-the-port-from-isaiahs-clean-base.md:46:- **Rebuild, with the reference as test oracle:** the observation encoding (named per-entity tensors instead of the flat v2 vector sliced at fixed offsets), the environment bindings, the codec, the model, the trainer seams, the configs and BC training.
